Early access to Seerr Companion: manage your Seerr, Jellyseerr or Overseerr server from your phone or TV.

New in this build:
- Discover movies, TV, people and collections, with title search
- Request a title, a season or a collection from its page, with 4K where your server allows it
- A Watchlist button on title and series pages
- Watch opens the title in your media server's app, or its web page
- Seasons and episodes on series pages
- A Discover tab on tablets
